@startuml
title Customer fee confirmation and booking — Proposed 2.0
skinparam shadowing false
|Customer (React or Flutter)|
start
:Enter delivery input;
|Delivery API|
:Authenticate Customer; validate input and both zones;
if (Authorized and valid?) then (yes)
  :Select tariff by deliveryAddress.zoneId, size and version;
  :Preserve pickup zone independently; no cross-zone surcharge;
  :Persist full input and 10-minute owner quote;
else (no)
  :Return 401 for missing/invalid credentials,
  403 for wrong role, 400 for invalid input,
  422 for unsupported or inactive zone;
  stop
endif
|Customer (React or Flutter)|
:Preview fee;
if (Accept fee?) then (yes)
  :CreateParcel with quoteId, total and key;
else (no)
  :Exit; no parcel created;
  stop
endif
|Delivery API|
:Authenticate Customer and validate confirmation/key;
if (Authorized and valid?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :Return 401 / 403 / 400;
  stop
endif
:Resolve or atomically reserve principal/operation/key;
if (Changed fingerprint, expired key or unresolved concurrent request?) then (yes)
  :409 conflict; no second booking;
  stop
endif
if (Committed identical duplicate within replay window?) then (yes)
  :Return original 201, exact body and Location,
  even when quote expired or consumed;
  stop
endif
:Read quote after committed replay check;
if (Quote exists and belongs to Customer?) then (yes)
else (no)
  :404 for missing/foreign quote; rollback reservation;
  stop
endif
if (Quote unexpired, unused and total accepted?) then (yes)
  :One transaction consumes quote and saves Created,
  price snapshot, history, outbox and response;
  :Return 201;
else (no)
  :409; rollback reservation; requote if expired;
  stop
endif
|Delivery outbox relay|
:Publish StatusChanged after commit;
if (Broker confirms?) then (yes)
  :Mark outbox sent;
else (no)
  :Keep pending and retry with same eventId;
endif
stop
@enduml
